==History==
2017
*The Battle Ram was once available in the [[Tournament/Special Event Challenges|Battle Ram Challenge]], which started on 3/2/2017. In this [[Tournament|challenge]], the player would build a [[Battle Decks|deck]] which included the Battle Ram. If the player achieved at least 5 wins, they obtained the Battle Ram early, in addition to the normal prizes.
*The Battle Ram [[Cards|card]] was generally released on 10/2/2017. On the same day, a [[Version History#Maintenance Break (10/2/2017)|maintenance break]], fixed an issue where the Battle Ram offer was missing from the [[Shop]].
*On 13/3/2017, the [[Version History#March%202017%20Update%20(13/3/2017)|March 2017 Update]], changed the Battle Ram's sound effects.
*On 11/8/2017, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (11/8/2017)|Balance Update]], increased the distance required for charging to 4 tiles (from 3 tiles) and increased the [[Barbarians|Barbarian]]'s spawn time to 1 second (from 0.8 seconds).
2018
*On 4/6/2018, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (4/6/2018)|Balance Update]], decreased the Barbarians' attack time interval to 1.4 seconds (from 1.5 seconds) and made the Battle Ram affected by all forms of pushback.
*On 20/6/2018, the [[Version History#Summer%202018%20Update%20(20/6/2018)|Summer 2018 Update]], decreased the distance required for charging to 3.5 tiles (from 4 tiles). It also moved the [[Arenas|Arena]] to unlock this card from Builder's Workshop to Barbarian Bowl.
*On 5/9/2018, the [[Version History#September%202018%20Update%20(5/9/2018)|September 2018 Update]], changed it so that {{Rarity|Rare}} cards start at Level 3 and end at Level 13 (from 1 to 11).
2019
*On 7/1/2019, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (7/1/2019)|Balance Update]], decreased the Battle Ram's damage and charge damage by 11%.
*On 4/3/2019, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (4/3/2019)|Balance Update]], decreased the Barbarians' hitpoints by 13%.
2020
*On 28/5/2020, a maintenance break, added a card render to the Battle Ram's card info screen.
2021
*On 27/10/2021, the [[Version History#Champions%20Update%20(27/10/2021)|Champions Update]], increased the Level cap of all cards to 14 (from 13).
*On 7/12/2021, the [[Version History#Balance%20Changes%20(7/12/2021)|2021 Quarter 4 Update]], increased the Battle Ram's damage and charge damage by 8%.
2022
*On 7/6/2022, a [[Version History#Balance%20Changes%20(7/6/2022)|Balance Update]], decreased the Barbarians‘ attack time interval to 1.3 seconds (from 1.4 seconds).
2023
*On 19/6/2023, the [[Version History#Card%20Evolution%20Update%20(19/6/2023)|Card Evolution Update]], increased the Level cap of all cards to 15 (from 14). It also added the CHARGE!!! [[Card Mastery]] task for the Battle Ram.
*On 8/8/2023, a [[Version History#Balance%20Changes%20(8/8/2023)|Balance Update]], increased the Battle Ram's hitpoints by 6% and decreased the distance required for charging to 3 tiles (from 3.5 tiles).
2024
*On 1/4/2024, the [[Version History|April 2024 Update]], added the Battle Ram’s Evolution.
2025
*On 31/3/2024, the [[Version History#2025 Quarter 1 Update (31/3/2025)|2025 Quarter 1 Update]], increased the Battle Ram's hitpoints by 0.1% and its charge damage by 0.17%. It also fixed a bug where Barbarians would not spawn after being buffed by [[Royal Chef]].

